# Diagnostics, Failure Tests, and Performance

Status: IN_PROGRESS
Milestone: M3 Hardening
Dependencies: 04_PROJECT_FOUNDATION.todo, 06_CAPTURE_POLICY.todo

## Purpose

Make failures reproducible without collecting notes, and test beyond the happy path.

## Tasks

- [x] Add Core parsing/persistence/transcript tests and20 synthetic audio-protocol/lifecycle test groups.
- [ ] Add interactive Windows tests for HWND generations/styles, focus, hotkeys, and recovery.
- [ ] Cover C01-C14 in docs\QUALIFICATION.md at the appropriate automated/manual layer.
- [ ] Add bounded event codes/native-error diagnostics with no notes, file paths, clipboard, or dumps.
- [ ] Provide user-reviewed diagnostic export with OS/app/runtime/GPU facts and redaction.
- [ ] Measure approved latency/CPU/memory budgets and perform the 60-minute soak.
- [ ] Check handles, subscriptions, hotkeys, IPC, file locks, and shutdown for resource leaks.
- [ ] Keep headless CI results separate from physical-desktop and recipient-capture evidence.
- [ ] Define regression triggers for framework/rendering/popup/native/API/runtime changes.

## Acceptance criteria

- [ ] Existing chosen build/tests pass with actual commands and results recorded.
- [ ] Injected API/I/O/IPC faults are visible and preserve notes without unprotected fallback.
- [ ] Diagnostics contain no synthetic canary note or private paths in intentional emissions.
- [ ] Measured budgets pass or are explicitly revised/approved before release.
- [ ] Every manual-only or unavailable scenario is labelled, not counted as automated coverage.

## Completion evidence

- Core25tests, audio20groups, Python26tests and local UI/GDI/synthetic-speech evidence recorded.
- Actual user-approved render loopback->Vosk:11partials/3finals,37meter updates, expected phrase, zero faults.
- No full soak/performance/accessibility/fault/capture matrix or Docker runtime result claimed.
- Corrected save/confirmation race, malformed URI, partial restart loss, native-close reentry and
  minimized recovery; final synthetic UI and real blank-process lifecycle regressions passed.

